# StellarPay
Cross-border freelancer payment infrastructure powered by Stellar and USDC.
Overview
StellarPay helps freelancers and remote workers receive payments globally using USDC and Stellar.
The platform reduces expensive transfer fees, slow banking systems, and payment restrictions.
Users can:
• Receive international payments
• Generate invoices
• Convert USDC to local currency
• Send payment links
• Manage recurring invoices

---

Problem
Freelancers in many countries face:
• Delayed bank transfers
• High transaction fees
• PayPal restrictions
• Currency instability
• Limited payment access
StellarPay solves this using fast and low-cost stablecoin payments.

